⬇️FULL RECIPE⬇️
334 calories 33g protein (yes for the whole pint)😋🤤

The Tonight Dough Protein Ice Cream 😋🍦

Original recipe from my Recipe Book
Check out the link in my bio for my Creami Recipe Books with over 100 recipes like this one!

- 1 Chocolate Protein Shake (I like the ones from @Nurri or @getrawnutrition)
- 20g @Lakanto Monk Fruit sweetener
- 10g cocoa powder
- 1g (¼ tsp) salt
- 1g (¼ tsp) xanthan gum
Mix-ins:
- 28g @benandjerrys Tonight Dough Cookie Dough pieces (or any kind of cookie dough pieces)
- 2 @OREO Thins (cream removed)
334 calories 40g C, 10g F, 33g P

Instructions:
1. Blend all ingredients for the base and freeze (at least 16 hours)
2. Run under hot water for at least 60 seconds
3. Spin on “Lite Ice Cream” setting
4. Spin on “Respin” setting
5. Respin again if powdery
6. Make a hole down to the bottom with a butter knife and fill with Mix-ins
7. Run the “Mix-in” cycle

